{"id":"n71700-1-12","stage":1,"title":"장마 · 梅雨","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71700-1-12-1","ko":"올 여름은 계속 장마야.","zh":"今年夏天一直是梅雨天气。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"올","meaning":"今年","explanation":"올：今年","readings":[{"term":"올","audio":"/audio/d4e5ba0f9d89e82785b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22072","senseId":"1","lemma":"올","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올","audio":"/audio/d4e5ba0f9d89e82785b6.mp3"}},{"text":"여름은","meaning":"夏，夏天，夏季","explanation":"여름：夏，夏天，夏季；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"여름","audio":"/audio/4442e49ca3d7c1ba77c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67701","senseId":"1","lemma":"여름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여름은","audio":"/audio/a146cfad3f10525c9377.mp3"}},{"text":"계속","meaning":"继续，持续","explanation":"계속：继续，持续","readings":[{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17692","senseId":"1","lemma":"계속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}},{"text":"장마야.","meaning":"梅雨","explanation":"장마：梅雨；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"장마","audio":"/audio/450e1440e21148d42175.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71700","senseId":"1","lemma":"장마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"장마야","audio":"/audio/d5ea9a4f9afaa31db950.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d4e5ba0f9d89e827","term":"올","zh":"今年","audio":"/audio/d4e5ba0f9d89e82785b6.mp3","entryId":"22072","definition":"现在正在度过的年。","pronunciation":["올"]},{"id":"4442e49ca3d7c1ba","term":"여름","zh":"夏，夏天，夏季","audio":"/audio/4442e49ca3d7c1ba77c7.mp3","entryId":"67701","definition":"四季之一，介于春秋之间的季节。","pronunciation":["여름"]},{"id":"23a9f0224cc40ec0","term":"계속","zh":"继续，持续","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3","entryId":"17692","definition":"连续不间断。","pronunciation":["계ː속","게ː속"]},{"id":"450e1440e21148d4","term":"장마","zh":"梅雨","audio":"/audio/450e1440e21148d42175.mp3","entryId":"71700","definition":"夏季连续多日下雨的现象或天气；或指那样的雨。","pronunciation":["장마"]}],"audio":"/audio/53a7aa84d699cdc92c92.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71700-1-12-2","ko":"그러게 계속 비만 오고 햇빛 본 날이 며칠 없어.","zh":"是啊，一直下雨，见到阳光的日子没几天。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러게","meaning":"就是嘛，可不嘛","explanation":"그러게：就是嘛，可不嘛","readings":[{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36269","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}},{"text":"계속","meaning":"继续，持续","explanation":"계속：继续，持续","readings":[{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17692","senseId":"1","lemma":"계속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}},{"text":"비만","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비만","audio":"/audio/e9b52f31fc48cb25074a.mp3"}},{"text":"오고","meaning":"下，来","explanation":"오다：下，来；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"17","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오고","audio":"/audio/e469b1c24e60347db75e.mp3"}},{"text":"햇빛","meaning":"阳光，日光","explanation":"햇빛：阳光，日光","readings":[{"term":"햇빛","audio":"/audio/53e1a4a868c33516d0ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72476","senseId":"1","lemma":"햇빛","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"햇빛","audio":"/audio/53e1a4a868c33516d0ea.mp3"}},{"text":"본","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"