64a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"818c8a303c20bac0","term":"날","zh":"天，日","audio":"/audio/818c8a303c20bac05fae.mp3","entryId":"62254","definition":"晚上12点到第二天晚上12点之间的24小时。","pronunciation":["날"]},{"id":"879abb6ed1ed4d59","term":"며칠","zh":"几天","audio":"/audio/879abb6ed1ed4d59a03e.mp3","entryId":"36676","definition":"几个日子。","pronunciation":["며칠"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人或事物等实际上不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/3338311a5fae81abd6e0.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.407,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71700","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":47,"sequenceScore":2.0604,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["今年冬天一直在下雪。","今年夏天一直是梅雨天气。","今年夏天一直晴天，很少下雨。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是啊，晴天很多，几乎没下过雨。","是啊，只有今天下雨，前几天都晴朗。","是啊，一直下雨，见到阳光的日子没几天。"],"answer":2}]}
